  "id": "unity-in-variety",
  "term": "unity in variety",
  "definition": "In aesthetics, unity in variety is the value found when different things or parts of experience are perceived as having an underlying oneness. It refers to a pleasing sense of coherence within diversity, such as when an analogy links varied elements into a single whole.",
